# Visual Tone: Deep Matte Dread

Prefer **pure black as the base**, with deep blood crimson only as accent. Matte finish. Fear comes from thick dark color — not from light.

## Do

- Base surfaces: `#000000` (not tinted red-black fills)
- Crimson for text, borders, accents only (`#3a1010`, `#6b1515`, `#8b1e1e`, `#a32222`)
- Hard matte borders, flat fills, no bloom
- Sparse layout, cold short copy

## Don't

- Glow, bloom, neon, soft colored halos, shiny highlight lines
- Red-washed backgrounds pretending to be “dark”
- Bright candy reds / pink highlights (`#ff*`, luminous Material accents)
- Atmosphere gradients, scanline glitter

**Rule of thumb:** black base, deep crimson accent. Emitting light is not.
